, Anna, is expecting their fourth in July.\\n\", \"original_answer\": \"Jill Duggar Dillard, from the reality show \\\"19 Kids and Counting,\\\" has given birth to her first child, a son named Israel David. Jill, who is a student midwife, was prepared for the baby to go over his due date, which he did by over a week.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}", "role": "user"}], "model": "unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF", "seed": 69058, "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1}
